      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MIGHTY TROJAN (7) is a capable type and proved too strong last time to win by 0.8 lengths at Richmond Straight in a handy 18.03 beating Straight Out. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and four minor placings to his credit. Expected to measure up again. NAN SAID NO (3) broke from a low draw and filled a minor placing last start, beaten only 0.8 lengths (22.59) behind Cha Cha Ethics at this track. Smart beginner who should take advantage of the low draw. Leading chance. WHISKY BENT (4) was strongly fancied latest and proved too good with a 6 length win at Gosford in a handy 22.39. Awkwardly drawn but goes well at this distance. Solid beginner who can clear the tricky draw. One of the leading chances again. MY CAPE ESCAPE (2) collected a minor prize last start over this track and distance - must be considered.",
